# Phase 6, the first steps in the left section: five lines for a newcomer,
# each ticked by what happens (an agent in a tab, a job, a worker's row, an
# answer of the person's, the list of actions seen), and gone once all are.
agent T1.1: hang
file brief.md: Target: the shop | Change: your part | Constraints: none | Ownership: your own files | Acceptance: the check passes
orch: init
pane side: 32x40
expect-row "FIRST STEPS"
expect-row "✔ 1 start your agent"
expect-row "› 2 tell it what you want"
orch: run new "the shop"                            -> expect r1
task T1 "The cart" --name cart --check "exit 0" --brief brief.md
orch: start T1                                      -> expect "(T1.1)"
expect-row "first steps: "
click "first steps: "
expect-row "✔ 3 your agents appear here"
expect-row "› 4 what needs you lands"
orch: need question "Blue or green?"                -> expect n1
human: answer n1 green
expect-row "✔ 4 what needs you lands"
expect-row "› 5 ctrl+space s settings"
pane actions: 60x30
key /
expect-row "type to search"
pane side:
assert: n1 state answered answer green
